  "title": "· New Bags · Balenciaga Launches Fall 26 Collection: Le 7 Bowling Bag, Le City in New Materials",
  "original_title": "新包 | Balenciaga 上市秋季26系列新包：Le 7 保龄球包，Le City 新材质",
  "excerpt": "Balenciaga's Fall 26 bags reimagine the Le City in denim and calfskin, while the Le 7 adds a playful bowling bag silhouette.",
  "author": "撰稿 X LING 编辑 X VIVI",
  "date_iso": "2026-07-24",
  "date_label": "July 24, 2026",
