      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Balenciaga has just unveiled its Fall 26 collection of bags, with the iconic Le City line reimagined in washed denim and waxed calfskin in camel, delivering a cool, streetwise aesthetic with a touch of bohemian flair. The Le 7 series introduces a new bowling bag silhouette, whose clever \"bag-in-bag\" structure adds a playful twist to its clean, streamlined shape.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
