    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The newly designed men's Le 7 bowling bag features a voluminous, rectangular silhouette crafted from logo-coated canvas and smooth calfskin. A silver-tone metal twist-lock closure adds a refined finishing touch. The ample interior makes it ideal as a weekend duffel, business trip bag, or gym companion.",
