    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The medium Le 7 bowling bag is made from supple black lambskin, lined with Muscana sheepskin, resulting in a quietly luxurious and understated look. Its defining feature is the \"bag-in-bag\" construction, which cleverly creates three separate compartments. The rounded flap is secured by a vintage-effect metal turn-lock, perfectly catering to modern demands for versatile functionality.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
